Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: YREV57 Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: YREV57 reverb plugin (VST3, LV2)
 An open-source reverb inspired by mid-1980s digital reverberators, with a
 1985-style and a 1987-style era, built with JUCE.
 .
 YREV57 is an independent product, inspired by the Yamaha REV7 and REV5. It is
 not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Yamaha Corporation. Yamaha,
 REV7 and REV5 are trademarks of Yamaha Corporation, used here only to describe
 the hardware that inspired this plug-in.
